# Agentflow_AI — Implementation Plan

## Overview

Build **Agentflow_AI**, a full-stack AI Operations Automation Platform where operators describe automations in natural language, visualize them as workflow graphs, and execute them through a chain of cooperating AI agents — with real-time streaming, OAuth integrations, and a full audit trail.

The build follows the **6 phases** prescribed in the spec sheet and is bootstrapped from scratch inside `c:\Users\amrut\OneDrive\Desktop\SPECT\`.

