## Verification Plan

### Automated Checks (per phase)

```bash
# Backend health
curl http://localhost:5000/api/health

# Auth round-trip
curl -X POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/register \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{"name":"Test","email":"test@test.com","password":"Test@1234"}'

# Workflow generation (deterministic fallback)
curl -X POST http://localhost:5000/api/workflows/generate \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer <token>" \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{"prompt":"Send a Slack notification when a new row is added to Google Sheets"}'

# Execute a workflow
curl -X POST http://localhost:5000/api/workflows/<id>/execute \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer <token>"
```

